     "item": "black pepper, to taste",
     "aisle": "Pantry"
    }
   ],
   "steps": [
    {
     "text": "Heat the oven to 220C. Grate the frozen butter into the 300g self-raising flour with a pinch of salt and toss to coat.",
     "min": 8
    },
    {
     "text": "Stir in the buttermilk to make a soft dough, fold it over on itself three times, pat out 2cm thick and cut 8 biscuits.",
     "min": 8
